          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-20178 tests: add compression test suite",
        "message": "LU-20178 tests: add compression test suite\n\nAdd sanity-compr.sh test suite for CSDC with 109 test\ncases covering:\n\n- Basic write/read with each compression algorithm\n  (lz4fast, lz4hc, lzo) and all supported chunk sizes\n- Compression ratio validation ensuring compressed\n  data is smaller than uncompressed for compressible\n  content\n- Incompressible data handling (random data stored\n  uncompressed)\n- Mixed I/O patterns: sequential, strided, append,\n  partial-chunk, sub-chunk overwrites\n- Truncate and hole punch on compressed files\n- mmap, O_DIRECT fallback, and sendfile integration\n- Multi-component layouts with compression on\n  selected components\n- Sparse file handling and extent verification\n- Concurrent multi-client stress tests\n- Data integrity stress with compressible,\n  incompressible, and mixed data patterns\n\nSigned-off-by: Brian Barbisch <brbarbis@microsoft.com>\nTest-Parameters: Ignore\nChange-Id: Ic0567c7537935c0ef13bbba4718ce18b3feafa7e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
